cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "claimbridge-medula-spec: a guide-verified, machine-readable specification for MEDULA-compatible healthcare claim integrations"
message: >-
  If you use this specification in your work, please cite it using this
  metadata.
authors:
  - alias: kefyusuf
version: 0.12.0
date-released: "2026-11-28"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kefyusuf/claimbridge-medula-spec"
keywords:
  - MEDULA
  - SGK
  - healthcare
  - claims
  - interoperability
  - specification
  - registry
abstract: >-
  A language-neutral, machine-readable, registry-first specification for
  MEDULA-compatible healthcare claim integrations. It models services,
  methods, DVOs, enums, rules, workflows, and sandbox scenarios as a
  JSON-Schema-validated YAML registry with a generated, checksum-guarded
  distribution bundle. All content is guide-verified with page-level
  provenance; the repository contains no real patient data.
